alkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":20150101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":3912486522,"text":"哲平の容態は？","nextNodeIds":[20150102,20150103]},{"nodeId":20150102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":964742922,"text":"今まで気づいてあげられなかったなんて…","nextNodeIds":[20150104]},{"nodeId":20150104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":1765219554,"text":"…すでに軍にあるすべての邪眼を接収するよう命を下しました。","nextNodeIds":[20150105]},{"nodeId":20150105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":933461482,"text":"ほとんどの人に生命力の流失が起きていましたが、深刻な状況には至っていません。","nextNodeIds":[20150106]},{"nodeId":20150106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":2730007362,"text":"ですが、ごく一部では…","nextNodeIds":[20150107]},{"nodeId":20150107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1039,"speakerName":"ゴロー","textMapHash":1397850378,"text":"珊瑚宮様、今からこの件で倒れた者の負傷兵営を設置し、彼らの容態を診たいと考えております。","nextNodeIds":[20150108]},{"nodeId":20150108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1039,"speakerName":"ゴロー","textMapHash":2635237122,"text":"ただ兵士たちは皆、邪眼と知ってもなお使い続けたいと騒いでいるようですが。","nextNodeIds":[20150109]},{"nodeId":20150109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":1117511466,"text":"この件はあなたに任せます。私は一度、前線へ向かわなければなりません。","nextNodeIds":[20150110]},{"nodeId":20150110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":1546527546,"text":"このような一大事が起これば、軍の心もきっと揺らぐことでしょう。その混乱に乗じて幕府軍が攻めてきてしまえば、今までの苦労も水の泡です。","nextNodeIds":[20150111]},{"nodeId":20150111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":3890884458,"text":"何かお考えはありますか？","nextNodeIds":[20150112]},{"nodeId":20150112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1264156946,"text":"ファデュイの計画を阻止する。","nextNodeIds":[20150113]},{"nodeId":20150113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":395501554,"text":"いけません、危険すぎます！","nextNodeIds":[20150114]},{"nodeId":20150114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":3307981682,"text":"鎖国令は未だ続いています。彼らの邪眼は恐らく稲妻で生産されたものでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[20150115]},{"nodeId":20150115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":161458922,"text":"これほど莫大な人員と資源を動かせるということは、背後に必ず本土の勢力が加担しているはず。","nextNodeIds":[20150116]},{"nodeId":20150116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":111184394,"text":"彼らを阻止するためには、邪眼を生産している工場を潰すしかありません。しかし、そこにはきっと厳重な警備が…","nextNodeIds":[20150117]},{"nodeId":20150117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":432964202,"text":"あなたにそのような危険を冒させるわけにはいきません。少なくとも軍と一緒に…","nextNodeIds":[20150118]},{"nodeId":20150118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3344766538,"text":"もう時間がない。","nextNodeIds":[20150119]},{"nodeId":20150119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1039,"speakerName":"ゴロー","textMapHash":2119321706,"text":"珊瑚宮様、邪眼の接収は急いで行われたため、ファデュイの目を誤魔化せていない可能性があります。","nextNodeIds":[20150120]},{"nodeId":20150120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1039,"speakerName":"ゴロー","textMapHash":209580786,"text":"軍隊の準備でこれ以上時間を費やせば、ヤツらに勘づかれ、間違いなく逃げられるでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[20150121]},{"nodeId":20150121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":1620835146,"text":"はい…少し考えさせてください…","nextNodeIds":[20150122]},{"nodeId":20150122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":144923594,"text":"邪眼を接収する時から、この件についてはすでに考えていました。巨大な工場、見つかりにくい場所、そして輸送経路の近くにあり、材料の供給を確保しなければならない…","nextNodeIds":[20150123]},{"nodeId":20150123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":2113875066,"text":"これらの条件に合う場所はそう多くありません。それに兵士たちが邪眼を手に入れた場所から推測するに、工場は<color=#00E1FFFF>ヤシオリ島</color>南西部の海に面した山崖にある可能性が高いでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[20150124]},{"nodeId":20150124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":1988545866,"text":"私はあなたを止めません。しかし、くれぐれもお気を付けください。","nextNodeIds":[20150125]},{"nodeId":20150125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1037,"speakerName":"珊瑚宮心海","textMapHash":2419895170,"text":"私たちは多くの戦友を失ってきました。あなたまで失いたくありません。","nextNodeIds":[20150126]},{"nodeId":20150126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3456461666,"text":"行こう。","nextNodeIds":[20150127]},{"nodeId":20150127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3178184498,"text":"え？その<color=#00E1FFFF>邪眼工場</color>に行くのか？","nextNodeIds":[20150128]},{"nodeId":20150128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2841992354,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[20150129]},{"nodeId":20150129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3786752178,"text":"本気なのか？もう少し考えてみても…うぅ、わかったよ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":20150103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2790443178,"text":"容態が急に悪くなった。","nextNodeIds":[20150104]}]},{"talkId":201552,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDupli