xt":"稲妻の外側はとても強固に見えるけど、内側は…僕たちが利用できるほど綻びに満ちていたよ。ほんの少し手間をかけるだけで、内部から攻め落とせるほどにね。","nextNodeIds":[20150417]},{"nodeId":20150417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10013,"speakerName":"「散兵」","textMapHash":3637082698,"text":"「永遠」は時間を非常に長く伸ばすことができる。だけど、その間にある一つ一つの節目はとてつもなく脆弱なものになるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[20150418]},{"nodeId":20150418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10013,"speakerName":"「散兵」","textMapHash":1145680402,"text":"抵抗軍にいる君の友達のように、どんなに努力しても、無駄なのさ。","nextNodeIds":[20150419]},{"nodeId":20150419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10013,"speakerName":"「散兵」","textMapHash":494872338,"text":"水中の泡のように、美しさを放った後は、破滅が待っている。","nextNodeIds":[20150420]},{"nodeId":20150421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2337464386,"text":"哲平は…","nextNodeIds":[20150423]},{"nodeId":20150422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3992343410,"text":"彼は無能なんかじゃない！","nextNodeIds":[20150423]},{"nodeId":20150420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10013,"speakerName":"「散兵」","textMapHash":1963108658,"text":"失えば失うほど手にしたいと思い、無能であればあるほどそれに抗う！アッハハハ、こういう茶番は、見ていて滑稽で実に楽しいものだね。","nextNodeIds":[20150421,20150422]},{"nodeId":20150423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1472328626,"text":"#おい！{NICKNAME}、落ち着け——","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[201504,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[201505,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_MY_WORLD","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1119,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FAIL_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","398"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLB